---
import "./series-visual.css";
---

<figure
  class="async-timeline series-visual not-prose"
  aria-labelledby="async-timeline-title"
>
  <p id="async-timeline-title" class="figure-title">
    等待模型回复时，Agent 仍能处理输入
  </p>
  <p class="reading-hint">按 T1 → T2 → T3 阅读 · 每个时间点对照两列状态</p>
  <div class="lanes">
    <div class="lane-title">本地 Agent</div>
    <div aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="lane-title">模型服务</div>

    <div class="time-point"><strong>T1</strong><span>发出模型请求</span></div>
    <div class="step">
      <strong>发起模型调用</strong>
      <span>等待回复的函数暂停</span>
    </div>
    <div class="connector" aria-label="请求发往模型服务">→</div>
    <div class="step service">
      <strong>收到请求</strong>
      <span>开始生成回复</span>
    </div>

    <div class="continuation" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
    <div aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="continuation" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>

    <div class="time-point">
      <strong>T2</strong><span>等待期间，用户输入到达</span>
    </div>
    <div class="step input">
      <span class="event-label">用户输入到达</span>
      <strong>执行输入处理函数</strong>
      <span>处理已收到的用户操作</span>
    </div>
    <div aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="step waiting">
      <strong>仍在生成</strong>
      <span>本次等待尚未结束</span>
    </div>

    <div class="continuation" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
    <div aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="continuation" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>

    <div class="time-point"><strong>T3</strong><span>模型返回内容</span></div>
    <div class="step reply">
      <span class="event-label">模型内容到达</span>
      <strong>继续处理模型回复</strong>
      <span>等待结果的代码恢复执行</span>
    </div>
    <div class="connector" aria-label="模型服务返回内容">←</div>
    <div class="step service">
      <strong>返回内容</strong>
      <span>本次等待有了结果</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    T1–T3
    表示先后顺序，不代表固定耗时。本地输入处理与回复处理交替执行，模型服务在远端生成内容。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .async-timeline {
    margin: 1.8rem 0;
    color: var(--series-ink);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    container-type: inline-size;
  }
  .figure-title {
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .reading-hint {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }
  .lanes {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 3rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .lane-title {
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0 0.6rem 0.6rem;
  }
  .time-point {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin: 0.3rem 0 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .time-point strong {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--series-blue);
    border-radius: 0.3rem;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.45rem;
    color: var(--series-blue);
    background: var(--series-blue-wash);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .time-point::after {
    content: "";
    flex: 1;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
  }
  .step {
    border: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    background: var(--series-paper);
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .step strong,
  .step span {
    display: block;
  }
  .step span {
    color: var(--series-secondary);
  }
  .input {
    border-color: var(--series-blue);
    background: var(--series-blue-wash);
  }
  .input .event-label {
    color: var(--series-blue);
  }
  .reply {
    border-color: var(--series-feedback);
  }
  .reply .event-label {
    color: var(--series-feedback);
  }
  .event-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }
  .waiting {
    border-style: dashed;
    background: var(--series-canvas);
  }
  .connector {
    align-self: center;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--series-blue);
  }
  .continuation {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
    padding: 0.3rem 0;
  }
  figcaption {
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }
  @container (max-width: 450px) {
    .lanes {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 1.6rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .step {
      padding: 0.65rem 0.6rem;
    }
    .lane-title {
      padding-left: 0.3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
